; ColdSoakMapScale ($0A68): 2D table, 5 points, unsigned
; MAP to row position of ColdSoakMapCoolant
; x: kpa, y: pos256 (units: docs/en/calibration.md)
; Inputs: Map
; Read at $10EF2
;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ColdSoakMapScale:
        dc.b    5,$80                                    ; points, flags
