        BRCLR   >Options032C,#$40,L0DAB2                 ; bit 6: flex-fuel (ethanol) calibration: FlexEthanol and the flex learning are used
        BRCLR   >FlexStartFlags,Z,#$28,L0DAB2            ; bit 5: cold flex start mileage passed: cold start handling over (CheckPowerDown, FlexColdStartMiles); bit 3: high ethanol at reset (FlexEthanol at or above FlexColdStartEthanolMin): flex cold start
        BRSET   >FlexStartFlags,Z,#$08,L0DAB6            ; bit 3: high ethanol at reset (FlexEthanol at or above FlexColdStartEthanolMin): flex cold start
        BCLR    <FlexStartFlags,Z,#$10                   ; bit 4: flex adaptive cell raised (FlexCellCheck); O2CellUpdate reads it
        BRA     L0DAB6
L0DAB2:
