        LDAA    >Options033F
        STAA    >Options033FCopy,Z
        BCLR    <FlexStartFlags,Z,#$20                   ; bit 5: cold flex start mileage passed: cold start handling over (CheckPowerDown, FlexColdStartMiles)
        LDAA    #$36
