        JSR     KickWatchdogsLong
        LDAA    #$20
L0DF14:
        BRCLR   >IoInputs0,Z,#$08,L0DF28                 ; bit 3: key off, probably: the monitors skip while it is set and CheckPowerDown starts the power-down path
