        JSR     O2HeaterMonitor
        JSR     IacResetLoop
L0E054:
        BSET    <FlexStartFlags,Z,#$04                   ; bit 2: power-down tasks running (CheckPowerDown)
        LDAA    >EngineOffTimeStart,Z
